{"id":"01ff954c42fa05a6","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-term-interpretation.md","title":"项求值","display":"df-term-interpretation — 项求值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-term-interpretation","aliases":["18-df-term-interpretation"],"display":"df-term-interpretation — 项求值","depends_on":["[[18-df-variable]]","[[18-df-structure]]","[[18-df-assignment]]","[[18-df-term]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"4.2.6","source_printed_pages":"48","source_pdf_pages":"58","source_correspondence":"term-evaluation-correspondence","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-term-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-term-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-interpretation — 项求值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adee8e90809320b8\" href=\"?note=adee8e90809320b8\" title=\"18-df-variable\">18-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ac3a6265513490d\" href=\"?note=9ac3a6265513490d\" title=\"18-df-structure\">18-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95cd5e4d0506772c\" href=\"?note=95cd5e4d0506772c\" title=\"18-df-assignment\">18-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a51b88c3e3a72ba5\" href=\"?note=a51b88c3e3a72ba5\" title=\"18-df-term\">18-df-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.2.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"48"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"58"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"term-evaluation-correspondence"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ac3a6265513490d\" href=\"?note=9ac3a6265513490d\" title=\"18-df-structure\">18-df-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"95cd5e4d0506772c\" href=\"?note=95cd5e4d0506772c\" title=\"18-df-assignment\">18-df-assignment</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a51b88c3e3a72ba5\" href=\"?note=a51b88c3e3a72ba5\" title=\"18-df-term\">18-df-term</a> 的有限项树，变量集与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"adee8e90809320b8\" href=\"?note=adee8e90809320b8\" title=\"18-df-variable\">18-df-variable</a> 相同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F_n\">\\(f\\in F_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>；求值函数按有限树结构递归引入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}:\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}:\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\beta(x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(c)&amp;\\coloneqq c^{\\mathfrak A},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\n&amp;\\coloneqq f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_n)),\\\\\nt^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\beta(x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(c)&amp;\\coloneqq c^{\\mathfrak A},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\n&amp;\\coloneqq f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t_n)),\\\\\nt^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}(t).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 4.2.6 的对象项求值。构造子单射且像不交，有限树结构递归给出唯一函数；各分支值在A中由结构解释的类型条件保证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"adee8e90809320b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"9ac3a6265513490d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on",